{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>由 Yak &amp; 推出的 Agent A 現於 Epic Games 平台開放 Android 版 限時免費 ，玩家可在 10 月 22 日 23:00（香港時間）前領取。作品結合間諜、冒險與解謎元素，並以密室逃脫和隱藏物件玩法為核心，適合喜歡動腦推理的玩家。</p><p>遊戲背景帶有特務、秘密與神秘紅寶石等元素，玩家需要在客房等場景中搜尋可疑物品。操作方式屬指向和點擊，玩家可點按畫面調查環境、收集道具、組合線索，再解開機關與謎題。隨著任務推進，玩家要逐步揭開隱藏內容，完成逃脫或調查目標。</p><p>Agent A 同時融合隱藏物件、密室逃脫與間諜等元素，官方簡介亦列出間諜、冒險、解謎、獨立、逃脫遊戲及謀殺遊戲等關鍵字。作品重點放在客房等場景的探索、線索搜查與機關破解，配合指向和點擊操作推進。對喜歡特務題材、密室逃脫與解謎玩法的 Android 玩家而言，這次限時免費可直接到 Epic Games 領取。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/fccc7c011f02a5c6c782a7b8375a94f5394c7eb71c1e3bc5e150e4bff0864dd2/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2F7f7fc6f5693ece570f5e60ef39ce3c77.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/eb592c9585d26b89d7b5d34919ad704a37d07baee88e10e3db415c7ed0fe2565/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2Fea42fd91bb40d53da41c61896c676eec.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/fc2b4c24c345fbba4647931ecd9fb1b5c7aaefed558dc8d111ec1e6c916cc4fd/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2F9e9cf8853502366bf3a6cc354a939b73.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6bd352e4594c9f66b3b4796a9f263897a5ba8a41cd35ccf58f2a18da07cff8ec/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2F3ade1cfe2d708d532069164fd6ed0350.jpg\"/><p>遊戲名稱：Agent A 支援平台：Android 領取位置： Epic Games</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T01:44:54.986513+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":439,"images":4,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T16:57:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T02:57:57.768746+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T01:38:53.268963+00:00","content_hash":"b2e3e470f3528195f551496e15329117104a9f371c94f52